<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Lua on Ricky</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/categories/lua/</link><description>Recent content in Lua on Ricky</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2025 16:56:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linzeyan.github.io/categories/lua/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Go Practical Guide: Execute Lua Scripts with go-redis</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2025/20250722-go-redis-lua/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2025 16:56:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2025/20250722-go-redis-lua/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.liwenzhou.com/posts/Go/go-redis-lua/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Go Practical Guide: Execute Lua Scripts with go-redis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
